   "key": "opening",
   "text": "Vendor B wins at €2,960 a month, billed monthly in EUR, about $39,617 over the 12 months, edging out Vendor A's $40,800. Vendor C is cheapest at $34,500, but it is prepaid up front, and paying that would drop your cash to $19,500 on day 45 when quarterly tax lands, below your $20,000 reserve floor. You can revisit Vendor C on 2027-01-31, or sooner if your cash can hold $20,000 through the horizon with it.",
