  },
  {
   "key": "reopened",
   "text": "Vendor A wins at $3,400 a month, $40,800 over the year, billed monthly with cancel any time. Vendor C is cheaper at $34,500, but it is prepaid up front, and paying it would push your cash to $19,480 on day 45, when quarterly tax lands, below your $20,000 floor. Vendor B, your incumbent, raised its price from €2,960 to €3,612 a month, about $4,029, over your $3,750 budget. Revisit Vendor C on 2027-01-31.",
   "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
