    "input": 1542,
    "output": 929
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "recheck",
   "text": "With Northwind Traders' $30,000 payment in, Vendor C now wins over your current pick, Vendor B. Vendor C costs $34,500 for the 12 months, prepaid up front, which works out to $2,875 a month, under your $3,750 budget. Paying it all at once still leaves your cash at its lowest of $35,980 on day 84, safely above your $20,000 reserve floor. Vendor B, billed €3,017 monthly in euros, comes to $40,380 over the term, and Vendor A's cancel-any-time deal costs $40,800.",
   "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
